    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>读法三</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 472, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 430, marginRight: 30, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Image src="../课件/assets/img_waves.jpg" style={{ width: 430, height: 290, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 10 }}>水波纹 · 对应原文“一圈圈推出去的波纹”</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>判据：箭头必须有字</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 16 }}>己 → 家：是“生在其中”</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>家 → 族：是“沿父系扩大”</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>族 → 乡：是“聚村而居”</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 10 }}>没字的箭头等于没画。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
